                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2372/30.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Dudley to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Rio</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-06-14"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">June 14, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Penna died this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dudley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
